<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Samrand, Shoredits talks scrapped.</title>
<headline>Samrand, Shoredits talks scrapped.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samrand Development Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that negotiations with Shoredits Holdings Ltd had been terminated.</p>
<p>The two companies had previously said they were in talks on the intention of Samrand acquiring a controlling interest in Shoredits. The talks were first announced in November.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
